# Cấu hình nhà cung cấp AI và định tuyến tác vụ AI (hợp đồng C5).
# Không ghi API key ở đây: key nằm trong .env.
# Mỗi tên provider dùng khóa riêng tương ứng trong .env.example.

[providers.anthropic]
type = "anthropic"

[providers.anthropic.models."claude-sonnet-5-5"]
vision = true
structured = true

[providers.anthropic.models."claude-haiku-5-5"]
vision = true
structured = true

# https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-5-mini
[providers.openai]
type = "openai_compat"
base_url = "https://api.openai.com/v1"
[providers.openai.models."gpt-5-mini"]
vision = true
structured = true

# https://aistudio.google.com/docs/models/gemini-3.6-flash
[providers.gemini]
type = "gemini"
[providers.gemini.models."gemini-3.6-flash"]
vision = true
structured = true

# https://api-docs.deepseek.com/guides/vision/
[providers.deepseek]
type = "openai_compat"
base_url = "https://api.deepseek.com"
[providers.deepseek.models."deepseek-flash"]
vision = true
structured = false

# https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/qwen-structured-output
[providers.qwen]
type = "openai_compat"
base_url = "https://dashscope-intl.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1"
[providers.qwen.models."qwen-vl-max"]
vision = true
structured = false

# https://docs.z.ai/guides/capabilities/struct-output
[providers.glm]
type = "openai_compat"
base_url = "https://api.z.ai/api/paas/v4"
[providers.glm.models."glm-4.7"]
vision = false
structured = false

# https://platform.kimi.ai/docs/guide/use-json-mode-feature-of-kimi-api
[providers.kimi]
type = "openai_compat"
base_url = "https://api.moonshot.ai/v1"
[providers.kimi.models."kimi-k3.1-pro"]
vision = true
structured = false

# https://openrouter.ai/openai/gpt-5-mini/
[providers.openrouter]
type = "openai_compat"
base_url = "https://openrouter.ai/api/v1"
[providers.openrouter.models."openai/gpt-5-mini"]
vision = true
structured = true

# Mỗi tác vụ AI: danh sách (provider, model) theo thứ tự ưu tiên.
# media.vision chỉ được gán cho model có vision = true.
[tasks]
"analysis.classify" = [{ provider = "anthropic", model = "claude-sonnet-5-5" }]
"analysis.video_verdict" = [{ provider = "anthropic", model = "claude-haiku-5-5" }]
"media.vision" = [{ provider = "anthropic", model = "claude-sonnet-5-5" }]
